onMap":{"java":{"insertions":0,"deletions":23}}},{"hash":"b9e836ab355a77301664c46de96fc4aff63937c8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add assertions for internal invariants","messageBody":"Several components rely on assumptions established by parsing, FXML\ninjection, and task-list command validation. These assumptions are not\ndocumented at the points where they are consumed, so programming errors\ncan surface later as less informative null or index failures.\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":84,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"b6417c5ce83a4ce8e3eba85b122395f3ff76cf70","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve code readability and structure","messageBody":"Several classes contain duplicated command logic, recycled variables,\nshort names, mutable state that never changes, and unexplained literals.\nThese issues make control flow and object responsibilities harder to\nfollow and increase the risk of inconsistent changes.\n\nRefactor parsing and command execution into focused helpers with\ndescriptive names. Consolidate task validation and task-added response\nlogic while keeping happy paths prominent.\n\nMake stable model state immutable, reduce variable scope, replace\nstorage-format literals with named constants, and use locale-independent\ntext normalization. Improve UI names and report FXML loading failures\nclearly.\n\nUpdate the find-command test to verify the returned response instead of\ncapturing unrelated console output. Complete affected documentation and\nstyle fixes to keep the codebase consistent.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"fxml":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"java":{"insertions":239,"deletions":210}}},{"hash":"b415d49041055518458e0d871c829bfef993021a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #1 from zaru-noodles/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Add assertions for A-Assertions","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"d7b4b4592c3107c00c248af14aa183